<blockquote class="uncited"><div>.is there any way to keep it from timing out?,would a hotspot help.<br>Regards</div></blockquote>No, you can not. because the repeater is not yours and you have no way to configure it. If you own a hotspot, then you can configure it the way you want. you can say a talk group will be there forever (Static) or something like that.<br><br>Hope this help,<br>Charlie,<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=5068">KA1CM</a> — Sat Jun 07, 2025 5:14 pm</p><hr />
